.TH MAILOVE 1 "2026-08-13" "mailove 2.4" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mailove \- lightweight IMAP mail client for the KDE desktop
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mailove
.RI [ mailto\-URL ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Mailove
is an IMAP mail client focused on speed and safe message viewing. It caches
headers, bodies and the folder tree in SQLite for instant, offline\-capable
browsing and full\-text search, and renders HTML mail in a sandboxed
QtWebEngine view that blocks all remote content until you opt in per message.
.PP
Accounts are configured from the application's account sheet. Passwords and
OAuth tokens are stored in the system keyring (KWallet or any Secret Service
provider) via qtkeychain, never on disk in plain text.
.SH OPTIONS
.B Mailove
takes no options. A single optional
.I mailto:
URL may be passed to open the composer pre\-addressed; the package registers
.B mailove
as a handler for the
.I x\-scheme\-handler/mailto
MIME type.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B QT_QUICK_CONTROLS_STYLE
Overrides the QtQuick Controls style. When unset, Mailove forces
.IR org.kde.desktop .
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/mailove/mailove.conf
Account configuration.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/mailove/mailove/
SQLite message, folder and attachment cache.
.SH BUGS
Report bugs at <https://github.com/nekromoff/mailove/issues>.
